nimitta-mātraṁ bhava savya-sācin\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3309,\"bb\":2916,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/33/b2916/\",\"shadow_value\":\"tasmāt – therefore; tvam – you; uttiṣṭha – get up; yaśaḥ – fame; labhasva – gain; jitvā – conquering; śatrūn – enemies; bhuṅkṣva – enjoy; rājyam – kingdom; samṛddham – flourishing; mayā – by Me; eva – certainly; ete – all these; nihatāḥ – killed; pūrvam eva – by previous arrangement; nimitta-mātram – just the cause; bhava – become; savya-sācin – O Savyasācī.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"tasmāt\",\"translation\":\"therefore\"},{\"word\":\"tvam\",\"translation\":\"you\"},{\"word\":\"uttiṣṭha\",\"translation\":\"get up\"},{\"word\":\"yaśaḥ\",\"translation\":\"fame\"},{\"word\":\"labhasva\",\"translation\":\"gain\"},{\"word\":\"jitvā\",\"translation\":\"conquering\"},{\"word\":\"śatrūn\",\"translation\":\"enemies\"},{\"word\":\"bhuṅkṣva\",\"translation\":\"enjoy\"},{\"word\":\"rājyam\",\"translation\":\"kingdom\"},{\"word\":\"samṛddham\",\"translation\":\"flourishing\"},{\"word\":\"mayā\",\"translation\":\"by Me\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"ete\",\"translation\":\"all these\"},{\"word\":\"nihatāḥ\",\"translation\":\"killed\"},{\"word\":\"pūrvam eva\",\"translation\":\"by previous arrangement\"},{\"word\":\"nimitta-mātram\",\"translation\":\"just the cause\"},{\"word\":\"bhava\",\"translation\":\"become\"},{\"word\":\"savya-sācin\",\"translation\":\"O Savyasācī\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3310,\"bb\":2917,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/33/b2917/\",\"body_value\":\"Therefore get up. Prepare to fight and win glory. Conquer your enemies and enjoy a flourishing kingdom. They are already put to death by My arrangement, and you, O Savyasācī, can b