एतच्छ्रुत्वा वचनं केशवस्य
कृताञ्जलिर्वेपमान: किरीटी ।
नमस्कृत्वा भूय एवाह कृष्णं
सगद्ग‍दं भीतभीत: प्रणम्य ॥ ३५ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3320,\"bb\":2925,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/35/b2925/\",\"body_value\":\"sañjaya uvāca
etac chrutvā vacanaṁ keśavasya
kṛtāñjalir vepamānaḥ kirīṭī
namaskṛtvā bhūya evāha kṛṣṇaṁ
sa-gadgadaṁ bhīta-bhītaḥ praṇamya\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3321,\"bb\":2926,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/35/b2926/\",\"shadow_value\":\"sañjayaḥ uvāca – Sañjaya said; etat – thus; śrutvā – hearing; vacanam – the speech; keśavasya – of Kṛṣṇa; kṛta-añjaliḥ – with folded hands; vepamānaḥ – trembling; kirīṭī – Arjuna; namaskṛtvā – offering obeisances; bhūyaḥ – again; eva – also; āha – said; kṛṣṇam – unto Kṛṣṇa; sa-gadgadam – with a faltering voice; bhīta-bhītaḥ – fearful; praṇamya – offering obeisances.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"sañjayaḥ uvāca\",\"translation\":\"Sañjaya said\"},{\"word\":\"etat\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"śrutvā\",\"translation\":\"hearing\"},{\"word\":\"vacanam\",\"translation\":\"the speech\"},{\"word\":\"keśavasya\",\"translation\":\"of Kṛṣṇa\"},{\"word\":\"kṛta-añjaliḥ\",\"translation\":\"with folded hands\"},{\"word\":\"vepamānaḥ\",\"translation\":\"trembling\"},{\"word\":\"kirīṭī\",\"translation\":\"Arjuna\"},{\"word\":\"namaskṛtvā\",\"translation\":\"offering obeisances\"},{\"word\":\"bhūyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"again\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"āha\",\"translation\":\"said\"},{\"word\":\"kṛṣṇam\",\"translation\":\"unto Kṛṣṇa\"},{\"word\":\"sa-gadgadam\",\"translation\":\"with a faltering voice\"},{\"word\":\"bhīta-bhītaḥ\",\"translation\":\"fearful\"},{\"word\":\"praṇamya\",\"translation\":\"offering obeisances\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3322,\"bb\":2927,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/35/b2927/\",\"body_value\":\"Sañjaya said to Dhṛtarāṣṭra: O King, after hearing these words from the Supreme Personality of Godhead, the trembling Arjuna offered obeisances with folded hands again and again. He fearfully spoke to Lord Kṛṣṇa in a faltering voice, as follows.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3323,\"bb\":2928,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/35/b2928/\",\"body_value\":\"As we have already explained, because of the situation created by the universal form of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, Arjuna became bewildered in wonder; thus he began to offer his respectful obeisances to Kṛṣṇa again and again, and with faltering voice he began to pray, not as a friend, but as a devotee in wonder.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 11.35\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 11.35\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"children\":\"L