सर्वे नमस्यन्ति च सिद्धसङ्घा: ॥ ३६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3326,\"bb\":2930,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/36/b2930/\",\"body_value\":\"arjuna uvāca
sthāne hṛṣīkeśa tava prakīrtyā
jagat prahṛṣyaty anurajyate ca
